# Implementation

## Goal
Build and harden a classroom-ready, Blooket-style realtime quiz platform that runs locally first, supports Chromebook students, and includes fast mini-game testing workflows.

## Current Snapshot
- Core realtime host/student flow exists.
- Quiz + scoring + leaderboard exist.
- Blook selection before join exists.
- Mini-games exist and run between questions.
- Soccer mini-game has animated fussball-style UI.
- Host can run mini-game tests without quiz answers.
- Auto demo and smoke test scripts exist.

